**Public game link:** https://github.com/$REPO/blob/$COMMIT/index.html — serve locally: \`python3 -m http.server 3000 --directory .\` then open http://localhost:3000/ (tmux session \`app-server\` running). Also at \`project/index.html\` and \`dist/index.html\`.

**Final commit:** https://github.com/$REPO/commit/$COMMIT

**Deployment:** Pushed to \`opencode/33605581284\` — tmux \`app-server\` serves \`/index.html\` on port 3000 (200 OK, diff MATCH). Workflow will handle PR/Pages.

